# RAGfly — Environment variables
# Copy to .env, fill in, and load with: source .env
# NEVER commit .env with real values. Add .env to .gitignore.

# --- Operational (used on every call) ---
RAGFLY_API_URL=https://api.ragfly.ai
RAGFLY_API_KEY=rf_...          # your API key — the only credential agents need

# --- Optional: local document roots ---
# fs.home_var names the variable to set for each document/root.
# Example only: use the exact name returned by the document.
# RAGFLY_HOME_442681=/Users/you/Dropbox
# See ENV_VARS.md / MCP.md; a null home_var needs no local root.
